WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.290
The year 2300.

2
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:06.210
AyShe, who woke in capsule 23, awakened Elyra.

3
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:10.630
But a radio call from the darkness changed everything.

4
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.030
Elyra was waking up.

5
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.490
But it wasn't the only thing waking up.

6
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.020
AyShe, wake up. There's a signal.

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.100
Leon's capsule code.

8
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.590
Is Leon alive?

9
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.030
A red light was watching her.

10
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.910
Don't go to the Broken Isles, AyShe.

11
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:35.960
The signals lie there.

12
00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.490
The road is destroyed, but there's no other way.

13
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:41.190
The Broken Isles.

14
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.430
A shattered world in the sky.

15
00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.330
The signal was coming from there.

16
00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.750
Something's behind you! Don't stop, run!

17
00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:50.230
AyShe ran.

18
00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.610
The bridges are collapsing.

19
00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.530
The islands were breaking apart.

20
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.570
Just as she was about to fall, a hand caught her.

21
00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:04.110
Got you! Never jump like that again, okay?

22
00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:06.430
I'm Aslı.

23
00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.480
I woke up in a capsule too.

24
00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.750
I'm coming with you.

25
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.410
Aslı, why are you helping me?

26
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.480
The islands kept falling apart.

27
00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.930
Someone was watching them from afar.

28
00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:31.040
You're not alone anymore, AyShe.

29
00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.540
And far away, someone was watching them.

30
00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:36.860
The signal cuts off here.

31
00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.620
Someone is blocking it.

32
00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.800
The crystal tunnel was pulling them into the depths of Elyra.

33
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.200
Stand back.

34
00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.660
I don't want to hurt you.

35
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.620
The guardians had awakened.

36
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.040
Don't be afraid, they don't bite.

37
00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:54.620
Usually.

38
00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.080
I'm Eray.

39
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.120
I don't remember how I got here.

40
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.780
But I know every stone, every path.

41
00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.540
Why do these creatures listen to you, Eray?

42
00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.040
Just kidding... I think.

43
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.520
They recognized you.

44
00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.440
You're their missing piece.

45
00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:16.680
The door is opening.

46
00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.280
This is a seal of Elyra.

47
00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.250
Under the ice stood capsule number seven.

48
00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.020
It's not Leon.

49
00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:28.740
The capsule was opening.

50
00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.080
Where is Leon?

51
00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.220
Tell me.

52
00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.600
The voice wasn't Leon's.

53
00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.420
Someone imitated his voice.

54
00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.950
I've been waiting for you.

55
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.000
23.

